# DESIGN.md catalog

- Vendored catalog: `vendor/awesome-design-md/design-md/<brand>/DESIGN.md` (+ `preview.html` for visual QA).
- Active choice for this repo: `design/active/DESIGN.md` (set via `pnpm design-md:use <brand>`).
- See `docs/awesome-design-md.md` for workflow.

When the user asks for a new look, a landing page, or to match a reference brand:

1. Read the relevant `DESIGN.md` (active copy or a path they name).
2. Map tokens to existing stack (Tailwind v4, shadcn, `app/globals.css`, `lib/fonts.ts`) instead of replacing the whole design system unless they ask for a full redesign.
3. Prefer layout, spacing, typography, and motion rules from `DESIGN.md`; keep accessibility and project conventions.

Do not treat catalog files as permission to copy trademark branding in production UI.
